                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The Vera Blanc games are 15 years old or more, and they still stand strong in 2025. Huge appreciation to the developers for providing both games at a really low price (less than the price of a typical lunch).... the other games might seem old and a huge majority won't consider playing them in 2025, but the Vera Blanc games are truly remarkable, and unique, due to their mini games and art style. Better than many visual novels and even some AAA games in 2025.",
